{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Gameplay_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/1_Transform.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A special letter, endowed with a soul, embarks on a journey. Change your form to move forward: fly, swim, overcome obstacles, and be ready for unexpected encounters!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Rediscover_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/World.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Familiar things appear completely different when viewed from another perspective, such as from the deck of a tiny paper boat.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Explore_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3_Gameplay.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a unique adventure with multiple paths to discover. Choose your route, meet strange and charming characters, solve puzzles, uncover hidden locations, and stumble upon secrets in the most unexpected places.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Features_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/5_Suriken.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every origami form brings a new ability and changes the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calm, meditative atmosphere to relax and unwind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey through different eras and fantastical worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3448430?t=1749126360","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749126360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/21dc1fd5263b237ae366dd3c2e2a1fd0edb50fa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749126360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/21dc1fd5263b237ae366dd3c2e2a1fd0edb50fa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749126360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Gameplay_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/1_Transform.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A special letter, endowed with a soul, embarks on a journey. Change your form to move forward: fly, swim, overcome obstacles, and be ready for unexpected encounters!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Rediscover_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/World.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Familiar things appear completely different when viewed from another perspective, such as from the deck of a tiny paper boat.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Explore_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/3_Gameplay.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is a unique adventure with multiple paths to discover. Choose your route, meet strange and charming characters, solve puzzles, uncover hidden locations, and stumble upon secrets in the most unexpected places.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/Features_eng.png?t=1749126360\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448430/extras/5_Suriken.gif?t=1749126360\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every origami form brings a new ability and changes the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calm, meditative atmosphere to relax and unwind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A journey through different eras and fantastical worlds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Space Sauce Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor